# Publication modules (ADR-016)

When adding or editing a `PublicationModule` (`publish.yaml`):

1. Set **`profile:`** to one of `linkml-specification` | `ontology` | `implementation`.
2. Give each section a semantic **`kind:`** from `PublicationSectionKind` (DSP / ADR-016). Do not invent ad-hoc kinds.
3. Keep manifest **`type:`** as the render/wire format (`explorer`, `glossary`, `markdown-doc`, …) — orthogonal to `kind`.
4. Respect ProfileSpec:
   - `linkml-specification`: required overview, classes, schema-files; **forbidden taxonomy**
   - `ontology`: required overview, taxonomy, glossary; recommended classes (ontology-list), identity; forbidden schema-files/enumerations/slots
   - `implementation`: required overview, conformance; forbidden taxonomy
5. One kind `classes` — renderer mode comes from profile (`data-structure` vs `ontology-list`). Do **not** add `OWL Classes` / `SHACL Classes` kinds.
6. `taxonomy` is a **separate** kind (primary nav for ontologies), not a view flag on `classes`.

See: [docs/adr/ADR-016-publication-section-kinds-and-profiles.md](docs/adr/ADR-016-publication-section-kinds-and-profiles.md), [model-assets/specifications/moex-dsp/0.1/README.md](model-assets/specifications/moex-dsp/0.1/README.md).
